<h1>Deleting all changes for user {@user.name}</h1>
<div class="card card-warning">
  <p>This is IRREVERSIBLE.</p>
  <p>All user details will be destroyed.</p>
  <p>Are you really, really sure?</p>
</div>
<div class="form-control">
  {button_to("Abort", ~p"/profiles/#{@user}", class: "button")} {button_to(
    "Erase user",
    ~p"/admin/users/#{@user}/erase",
    method: "post",
    class: "button button-danger"
  )}
</div>
<p>
  This automatically creates user and IP bans but does not create a fingerprint ban. Check to see if one is necessary after erasing.
</p>
